<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS1" title="In 6 Perspectives and Applications ‣ Information Gravity: A Field-Theoretic Model for Token Selection in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.1 </span>Improving Generation Through Information Mass Management</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS2" title="In 6 Perspectives and Applications ‣ Information Gravity: A Field-Theoretic Model for Token Selection in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.2 </span>Adaptive Temperature Control</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS3" title="In 6 Perspectives and Applications ‣ Information Gravity: A Field-Theoretic Model for Token Selection in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3 </span>Quality and Interpretability Metrics for LLMs</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In Information Gravity: A Field-Theoretic Model for Token Selection in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Conclusion</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS1" title="In 7 Conclusion ‣ Information Gravity: A Field-Theoretic Model for Token Selection in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.1 </span>Key Results</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS2" title="In 7 Conclusion ‣ Information Gravity: A Field-Theoretic Model for Token Selection in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.2 </span>Perspectives for Model Development</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS3" title="In 7 Conclusion ‣ Information Gravity: A Field-Theoretic Model for Token Selection in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.3 </span>Possible Limitations</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS4" title="In 7 Conclusion ‣ Information Gravity: A Field-Theoretic Model for Token Selection in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.4 </span>Concluding Remarks</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
